        {
            "page_number": 6,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "text": "מה  זה ניהול פרויקט תוכנה ?"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "בהנדסת תוכנה מתייחסים להיבטים של התוכנה כפי שפירטנו.\nבניהול פרויקט אנחנו מתייחסים גם ל:\nהיבטים אנושיים,\nזמן פיתוח,\nתקציב,\nתהליך הפיתוח,\nעבודת צוות,\nלוחות זמנים, אספקות, תלויות.\nזאת לא אבחנה מדויקת (גם כי קו ההפרדה הוא מאד דינמי)  אבל זאת אבחנה מספיק טובה."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "page_number": 7,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "text": "מה נלמד בקורס? (1/2)"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Introduction, Overview of major SW development models\nBasic Activities:\nRequirements Management.\nSystem Design: System modeling & Architectural design\nSW Testing: Test case, Test Scenario, Test planning, Continuous testing\nIntegration, Integration planning ,Continuous Integration\nDistributed software engineering\nAgile & Scrum Vs. Classical project management (Waterfall)\nProject Planning. scope management, Scheduling & Tracking, TOC (Theory of constraints)\nThe role of the PM, Project management, PMI Model & PMI Matrix (the last 2 are optional)"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "page_number": 8,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "text": "מה אולי לא נלמד בקורס? (2/2)"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Some or all of the following topics according to the progress of the class:\nOther models of requirements analysis and description, more models of system architecture and design,\nHuman Communication, meeting management.\nSW quality Management\nRisk management, Improvement of SW development process (CMMI)\nPeople management. Adizes model. Maslow need hierarchy\nAbout 30% of the course will be dedicated to the course project: Management of a project of a distributed system (Without code)"
                }
            ]
        },
