            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "heading",
                    "text": "What’s the problem ?"
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "About 1/3 of the projects totally fail, a third are poorly completed, and a third are reasonably succeed\nMany projects are managed intuitively, some are managed very poorly, and others are not managed at all\nThere is a lot of practices, experience, knowledge, methodologies and theories that can help us to run projects in a better way:\nfaster (x4), with higher quality (1/20 of the escaped bugs), cheaper and with satisfied customers"
                }
            ]
        },
